  "version": "0.8.0",
  "changes": [
    "Independent v8 package and launchers; root legacy, v4, v5, v6 and v7 frozen.",
    "All detections receive native-channel aperture ADU and exposure-normalized ADU/s; catalogue stars and planet candidates share the same saved measurements.",
    "Per-channel saturated apertures remain flagged lower bounds; robust masked Moffat-wing models save separate total-count, count-rate, centroid and fit-quality diagnostics without entering extinction fitting.",
    "Ceres and Vesta join the planetary search through a committed offline 1850\u20132036 JPL Horizons ICRF LT+S reference and approximate apparent-V tracks.",
    "FITS EXPTIME/EXPOSURE and EXIF ExposureTime provenance is recorded; unavailable or conflicting exposure remains explicit.",
    "Recognize lossless bz2-wrapped FITS in scientific and post-fit metadata loaders; retain native samples and compressed-source provenance without changing model numerics.",
    "Portable v8 output/database selection through CLI, environment and host-specific user configuration; repository-local default retained.",
    "Parallel v8a work snapshot with independent go8a launcher; scientific modules and data unchanged from work v8."
  ],
